      "rationale": "מפה אל פה ('da ka na da') — cogo kelen-kelen na: dugukolo kunw na fɔ ka ta dugukolo kunw na; tubabukanw fɔ 'from one end to another'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ɲɛjɛgɛn",
      "rationale": "נדה\/טמאה ye 'ɲɛjɛgɛn (jasara)' ye — kɔrɔ ka kuntilenna dɔrɔn, tɛ 'filthiness' yɛrɛ ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "o ye",
      "rationale": "Bamanankan ka kopila ye; Heburukan נדה היא — היא bɛ yen, nka kopila-cogo farala."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "aw",
      "rationale": "Toraka kuma min bɛ wele Isirayili ye, nabiw bolo don."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "min ye i ka wasaliw ye, minnu na i ɲininka fɔ i ka warabaga nabiw bolo ko: dugukolo min na aw bɛ taa k'a minɛ, o ye dugukolo min ka ɲɛjɛgɛn ye, dugukolow ka jamanaw ɲɛjɛgɛn la, u ka ɲimaliw la, minnu ye a lajɛ da kroŋ ka na da kroŋ, u ka ɲɛjɛgɛn ye.",
